            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 italic leading-relaxed font-light">
              "Com a rotina cansativa de estudos e trabalho, eu costumava esquecer datas importantes ou taxas de inscrição. O sistema de monitoramento automático por e-mail me salvou no concurso do Banco do Brasil. Serviço essencial para quem estuda de verdade."
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 to-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs text-white">
                AS
              </div>
              <div class="leading-tight">
                <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Aline Souza</h4>
                <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-500">Aprovada no Banco do Brasil</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- 7. CTA FINAL ULTRA-PREMIUM -->
      <section class="text-center py-20 border-t border-white/5 relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(99,102,241,0.06)_0%,rgba(0,0,0,0)_70%)] blur-2xl -z-10 animate-slow-glow"></div>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-outfit font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-none">
            Pare de perder tempo com pesquisas manuais de editais.
          </h2>
          
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">
            Deixe nossa inteligência analisar diários oficiais complexos enquanto você foca no que realmente importa: a sua preparação intelectual.
          </p>

          <a 
            href="/cadastro" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-black font-extrabold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-xl hover:bg-slate-100 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer text-xs uppercase tracking-wider"
          >
            Descobrir Concursos Ideais Agora
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Sleek Minimal Footer -->
    <footer class="w-full border-t border-white/5 bg-[#020203] py-12 text-center text-xs text-gray-600 mt-24">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
        <p class="font-light">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} EditalHub. Tecnologia & Automação Inteligente de Editais.</p>
        <div class="flex gap-6 font-semibold">
          <a href="/login" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Administração</a>
          <a href="/cadastro" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Registrar Conta</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- GATILHO INTELIGENTE: MODAL DE CONVERSÃO ULTRA SOPHISTICATED -->
    <div id="conversion-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/85 backdrop-blur-md opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="bg-[#08080a] border border-white/15 rounded-3xl p-8 max-w-md w-full mx-4 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] transform scale-95 transition-all duration-300 space-y-6 relative overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Glowing edge decoration inside modal -->
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-500"></div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="p-3 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-2xl text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-outfit font-extrabold text-white">Desbloqueie o potencial máximo da nossa IA</h3>
        </div>
        
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Você experimentou nosso preview limitado. Ao realizar o cadastro gratuito, você habilita a análise profunda do diário oficial para seu CPF, além de:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-3.5 bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="text-emerald-400 shrink-0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Alertas personalizados em tempo real por E-mail</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="text-emerald-400 shrink-0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Acesso integral a todos os editais de bancas ativas</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="text-emerald-400 shrink-0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Calculadora avançada de compatibilidade profissional</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4 pt-2">
          <button id="close-conversion-btn" class="flex-1 py-3.5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/[0.03] text-gray-400 hover:text-white font-extrabold rounded-xl text-xs transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-wider">
            Voltar
          </button>
          <a href="/cadastro" class="flex-2 py-3.5 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-black font-extrabold rounded-xl text-xs text-center transition-all shadow-xl active:scale-95 block uppercase tracking-wider">
            Criar Conta Grátis
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Script Client-Side para Interação Premium Rápida -->
    <script define:vars={{ listagemFinal }}>
      // 1. Dados
      const contests = listagemFinal;

      // 2. Elementos
      const schoolFilters = document.getElementById('school-filters');
      const resultsSection = document.getElementById('results-section');
      const currentLevelTag = document.getElementById('current-level-tag');
      const statEncontrados = document.getElementById('stat-encontrados');
      const statSalario = document.getElementById('stat-salario');
      const statAbertas = document.getElementById('stat-abertas');
      const statPrevistos = document.getElementById('stat-previstos');
      const cardsContainer = document.getElementById('contest-cards-container');

      const conversionModal = document.getElementById('conversion-modal');
      const closeConversionBtn = document.getElementById('close-conversion-btn');

      // 3. Ações ao clicar em escolaridade
      schoolFilters?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        const btn = e.target.closest('button');
        if (!btn) return;

        const level = btn.dataset.level;

        // Estiliza o botão selecionado
        schoolFilters.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b => {
          b.className = "px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-indigo-600/10 hover:border-indigo-500/40 hover:text-indigo-200 border border-white/5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 transition-all cursor-pointer hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(99,102,241,0.1)] active:scale-95";
        });
        btn.className = "px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600/20 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/60 text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(99,102,241,0.15)] active:scale-95";

        // Filtra concursos correspondentes
        const filtered = contests.filter(c => c.escolaridade.toLowerCase() === level.toLowerCase());

        // Revela com suavidade
        resultsSection.classList.remove('hidden');
        setTimeout(() => {
          resultsSection.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
        }, 150);

        // Atualiza estatísticas com efeito de contagem rápida
        currentLevelTag.innerText = level;
        statEncontrados.innerText = filtered.length;
        
        const salarios = filtered.map(c => c.salario_inicial);
        const maxSal = salarios.length > 0 ? Math.max(...salarios) : 0;
        statSalario.innerText = maxSal > 0 ? `R$ ${maxSal.toLocaleString('pt-BR', { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}` : 'R$ 0';
        
        statAbertas.innerText = filtered.filter(c => c.inscricao_fim).length;
        statPrevistos.innerText = Math.floor(filtered.length * 0.25) + 1;

        // Injeta os cards de forma ultra-elegante
        cardsContainer.innerHTML = '';
        if (filtered.length === 0) {
          cardsContainer.innerHTML = `
            <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-3 text-center py-12 bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Nenhum concurso ativo processado para essa escolaridade no momento. Utilize o simulador avançado abaixo.</p>
            </div>
          `;
          return;
        }

        // Exibe top 3
        filtered.slice(0, 3).forEach(c => {
          const card = document.createElement('div');
          card.className = "bg-[#070709] border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-indigo-500/40 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(99,102,241,0.05)] transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer text-left";
          
          card.innerHTML = `
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-[8px] font-bold rounded uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
                  ${c.edital.organizadora.nome}
                </span>
                <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1 select-none font-mono">
                  ✦ Match ${c.compatibilidade}%
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="space-y-1">
                <h4 class="text-sm font-outfit font-extrabold text-white group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors line-clamp-1">${c.nome_concurso}</h4>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-semibold">Estado: <span class="text-gray-300 font-bold">${c.estado}</span> | Área: <span class="text-gray-300 font-bold">${c.area}</span></p>
              </div>

              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed font-light">${c.resumo}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
              <div class="flex flex-col">
                <span class="text-gray-600 text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Salário Inicial</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-white font-mono">R$ ${c.salario_inicial.toLocaleString('pt-BR', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })}</span>
              </div>
              <button class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-white/5 group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-black rounded-lg text-[9px] font-bold transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-1 trigger-conversion cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-wider border border-white/10 group-hover:border-transparent">
                Detalhes
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          `;
          cardsContainer.appendChild(card);
        });

        // Adiciona ouvintes para disparo do modal
        cardsContainer.querySelectorAll('.trigger-conversion, .bg-[#070709]').forEach(el => {
          el.addEventListener('click', (ev) => {
            ev.stopPropagation();
            openConversionModal();
          });
        });
      });

      // 4. Modal de Conversão
      function openConversionModal() {
        if (!conversionModal) return;
        conversionModal.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'pointer-events-none');
        const content = conversionModal.querySelector('div');
        if (content) {
          content.classList.remove('scale-95');
          content.classList.add('scale-100');
        }
      }

      function closeConversionModal() {
        if (!conversionModal) return;
        const content = conversionModal.querySelector('div');
        if (content) {
          content.classList.remove('scale-100');
          content.classList.add('scale-95');
        }
        conversionModal.classList.add('opacity-0', 'pointer-events-none');
      }

      closeConversionBtn?.addEventListener('click', closeConversionModal);
      conversionModal?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (e.target === conversionModal) closeConversionModal();
      });

      document.querySelectorAll('.trigger-global-conversion').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          openConversionModal();
        });
      });

      // 5. Simulador
      const runSimBtn = document.getElementById('run-simulation-btn');
      const simSpinner = document.getElementById('sim-spinner');
      const simSchool = document.getElementById('sim-school');
      const simState = document.getElementById('sim-state');
      const simArea = document.getElementById('sim-area');
      const simResult = document.getElementById('simulation-result');
      const simResCount = document.getElementById('sim-res-count');
      const simResSalary = document.getElementById('sim-res-salary');
      const simResHighlight = document.getElementById('sim-res-highlight');

      runSimBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        // Simulação de delay tecnológico para parecer processamento AI real
        if (simSpinner) simSpinner.classList.remove('hidden');
        runSimBtn.disabled = true;

        setTimeout(() => {
          if (simSpinner) simSpinner.classList.add('hidden');
          runSimBtn.disabled = false;

          const schoolVal = simSchool.value;
          const stateVal = simState.value;
          const areaVal = simArea.value;

          let filtered = contests;
          
          if (schoolVal) {
            filtered = filtered.filter(c => c.escolaridade.toLowerCase() === schoolVal.toLowerCase());
          }
          if (stateVal && stateVal !== 'Todos') {
            filtered = filtered.filter(c => c.estado.toLowerCase().includes(stateVal.toLowerCase()));
          }
          if (areaVal && areaVal !== 'Todas') {
            filtered = filtered.filter(c => c.area.toLowerCase().includes(areaVal.toLowerCase()) || c.resumo.toLowerCase().includes(areaVal.toLowerCase()));
          }

          const count = filtered.length;
          const salaries = filtered.map(c => c.salario_inicial);
          const avgSalary = salaries.length > 0 ? (salaries.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / salaries.length) : 0;

          if (simResult) {
            simResult.classList.remove('hidden');
            if (simResCount) simResCount.innerText = count;
            if (simResSalary) simResSalary.innerText = avgSalary > 0 ? `R$ ${avgSalary.toLocaleString('pt-BR', { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}` : 'R$ 0';
            if (simResHighlight) simResHighlight.innerText = areaVal !== 'Todas' ? areaVal : 'Geral';
            
            simResult.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
          }
        }, 800);
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  .font-outfit { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
  .font-jakarta { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
  
  @keyframes scan {
    0% { top: 0%; }
    50% { top: 75%; }
    100% { top: 0%; }
  }
  .animate-scan {
    animation: scan 4s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes slowGlow {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.8; }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }
  }
  .animate-slow-glow {
    animation: slowGlow 10s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fadeIn 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }
</style>
